              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="5">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Cut and cap solid timber geometry. Connect original Stock to Timber Preview's Stock Geometry to keep grain and knots fixed as the cut moves. Appearance inspired by Larsson et al. (2022), Procedural Texturing of Solid Wood with Knots. ACM Transactions on Graphics 41(4), Article 45 (SIGGRAPH 2022). https://doi.org/10.1145/3528223.3530081. Cut-aware procedural detail informed by Larsson et al. (2024), https://doi.org/10.1111/cgf.15074, and Mokume (2025), https://doi.org/10.1145/3730874; independent adaptation.</item>
                    <item name="Hidden" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">ae2b6dfb-fe6e-4fa7-b0dc-ed6d666e3275</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Timber Cut</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Knot section</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="8">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="2">
